<section class="sec" id="features"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="center r">
    <div class="eyebrow">Library</div>
    <h2 class="sech">Your whole collection,<br/>release-accurate.</h2>
    <p>Bring the albums you own into one library, then take them anywhere.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="cards">
    <div class="fcard r">
      <div class="top">
        <div class="emoji" style="background:rgba(155,108,246,.18);color:var(--violet)"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5.5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.5" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></div>
        <span class="no">01</span>
      </div>
      <h3>Releases, not folders</h3>
      <p>Point it at your music folders, and bae helps match each to the right release. Different releases of the same album are grouped together.</p>
      <div class="tags"><span>Metadata sources</span><span>Cover art</span><span>Releases grouped</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="fcard r d1">
      <div class="top">
        <div class="emoji" style="background:rgba(134,224,200,.18);color:var(--mint)"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/><path d="M8 8a5.66 5.66 0 0 0 0 8"/><path d="M16 8a5.66 5.66 0 0 1 0 8"/><path d="M4.93 4.93a10 10 0 0 0 0 14.14"/><path d="M19.07 4.93a10 10 0 0 1 0 14.14"/></svg></div>
        <span class="no">02</span>
      </div>
      <h3>Whole library, every device</h3>
      <p>Your cloud holds the library. Every device sees it all. Tracks download as they play; pins play offline.</p>
      <div class="tags"><span>Phone &amp; desktop</span><span>Offline pins</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="fcard r">
      <div class="top">
        <div class="emoji" style="background:rgba(247,168,196,.2);color:var(--pink-deep)"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 12 C4 6 5 6 6.5 12 C8 18 9 18 10.5 12 C12 6 13 6 14.5 12 C16 18 17 18 18.5 12 C20 6 21 6 22 12"/></svg></div>
        <span class="no">03</span>
      </div>
      <h3>Playback details</h3>
      <p>Albums keep their playback details: vinyl and cassette recordings pause on side breaks. CUE sheets enable playing pregaps from CDs.</p>
      <div class="tags"><span>CD pregaps</span><span>Vinyl side breaks</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="fcard r d1">
      <div class="top">
        <div class="emoji" style="background:rgba(155,108,246,.18);color:var(--violet)"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="7.5" cy="15.5" r="5.5"/><path d="M21 2l-9.6 9.6"/><path d="M15.5 7.5l3 3L22 7l-3-3"/></svg></div>
        <span class="no">04</span>
      </div>
      <h3>You control it</h3>
      <p>Your music stays yours. Your files stay where you put them. You control your library.</p>
      <div class="tags"><span>Your files</span><span>No lock-in</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></section>

